		}
		{
			dependencies: ["543F014BB97A45F4"]
			description: ["Mars's neodymium and plain hydrogen go in, &6Europium&r comes out, and nothing else in the pack makes it. It leaves the ring as a very hot liquid, not a plasma, so pipe it accordingly. The ZPM motor wants a lot of it as fine wire."]
			icon: "gtceu:europium_ingot"
